  "2. TRT-LLM EXPRESSIBILITY ADJUDICATION: demonstrate on TRT-LLM's shipping KvCacheRetentionConfig whether 'evict tool-output token ranges first, keep committed conversation scratch as LRU' is achievable as pure config WITHOUT a new classifier. If yes: mechanism novelty is empty and claim must be reframed to 'automatic classification policy for existing eviction infrastructure' (application contribution, not mechanism). If no: document what is missing and why.",
